    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Energy a little better</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>One episode of exertional chest tightness three weeks ago; none at rest</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>A brief twinge in the right big toe last week</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Grief still heavy but more bearable; no thoughts of death</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

